1. **Retell AI** (cloud) — holds the voice agent "Sarah" and places the calls. Agent ID `agent_1106515681f404064d0d5c008e`. Single-prompt agent, Kate voice, GPT-4.1, voicemail detection on with hang-up, `end_call` and `transfer_call` configured.
